					{ "mark": "老刘", "present": "chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2", "steps": [{ "line": "刘老农说道：“这位$RESPECT，多谢答救小女娟儿。” \n" }, { "line": "刘老农说道：“这口剑，这本密笈赠于$RESPECT。” \n" }, { "line": "刘老农说道：“这处非久留之地，我等去也。” \n" }, { "line": "刘老农领着娟儿匆匆离去。\n" }, { "unmark": "老刘" }, { "give": "es2:d/village/npc/obj/hengbing" }, { "give": "es2:d/village/npc/obj/parrybook" }, { "leave": "chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2" }, { "leave": true }] },
